  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leaving No One Behind: Improving the Skills and the Economic Opportunities for the Bangladeshi Community and Rohingya Women and Youth in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to support efforts towards the economic empowerment of the Bangladeshi host community and the Rohingya refugees in Cox&apos;s Bazar district. The project will focus on gender-sensitive market-related skills development linked to self-reliance activities in the camps by improving the technical skills of the Rohingya refugees, especially women and youth, and employment and self-employment in growth sectors for the host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
